=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# play runall/pending ------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Play mode, mocks: the Run All screen proposed for slice 8,$
# each row's state from the control's real Check, each change$
# the real control's Plan, all of them in one plan on the real$
# plan/apply engine. Which controls hardn.yml asks for, how a$
# row is skipped, a change pending read before any plan, and the$
# hostname asked whatever the risk are the gallery's stand-ins,$
# unit (b)'s to build. Nothing on this machine changes: every$
# command and file is the fake's.$
$
# Info: runall/pending$
# web-01.example.net runs Debian 13. debian13 a minute after an$
# SSH port change to 2230, not yet confirmed: nothing is planned$
# until hardn confirm.$
$
# Run All ######################################################$
$
# Controls -----------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  User                 Change pending$
   -  Firewall             Change pending$
   -  SSH Login            Change pending$
   -  SSH Auth             Nothing asked$
   -  SSH Port             Already as asked$
   -  AppArmor             Status only$
   -  Auto Updates         Change pending$
   -  DNS                  Change pending$
   -  Backups              Used, not changed$
   -  Environment          Nothing asked$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Apply all            Change pending$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter your choice [0-1 or q]: 1$
$
# Warning$
# A change is waiting for hardn confirm. Confirm it from a new$
# connection, or let it roll back, then try again.$
$
# Run All ######################################################$
$
# Controls -----------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  User                 Change pending$
   -  Firewall             Change pending$
   -  SSH Login            Change pending$
   -  SSH Auth             Nothing asked$
   -  SSH Port             Already as asked$
   -  AppArmor             Status only$
   -  Auto Updates         Change pending$
   -  DNS                  Change pending$
   -  Backups              Used, not changed$
   -  Environment          Nothing asked$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Apply all            Change pending$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter your choice [0-1 or q]: 0$
$
# simulated system ---------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Nothing was applied.$
$

